{
  "_comment": "Example .ucode/themes/<name>.json. Copy this file (minus _comment) into .ucode/themes/ or ~/.ucode/themes/, drop the _comment key, and name the file after your theme (or set a 'name' field). Colors are either a classic ANSI SGR code (number, e.g. 31) or a '#rrggbb' hex string (rendered as 24-bit truecolor). Omit any slot you don't want to override -- it falls back to the default theme's value. Use null to disable color for a slot entirely.",

  "name": "midnight",
  "description": "Deep blues and a single warm accent, for low-light rooms.",
